{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1470864-aberrant-ways-to-make-money-as-a-nova","id":1470864,"title":"(Aberrant) ways to make money as a nova","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-12-19T10:26:14-08:00","id":1470864,"title":"(Aberrant) ways to make money as a nova","content":"Say you just erupted as a nova on N-day and you decided you wanted to make money, how would you go about it and which powers would you have or do you think would work best?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26058-aeonstorm","name":"Aeonstorm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-19T11:11:38-08:00","id":1470867,"title":"","content":"Probably Transmutation would be the best power for making money. Make a few hundred Kilos of rare earth metals or other rare or difficult and expensive materials and you are practically printing your own money.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4178-stanlemon","name":"stanlemon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-19T12:02:48-08:00","id":1470871,"title":"","content":"Mega-Speed...gig delivery","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-19T13:39:06-08:00","id":1470877,"title":"","content":"In Nova Era, Novas are super stars. They basically don\u2019t need to worry to much about money, as money comes to them from companies asking for publicity jobs and offering things for using their products while on camera. Think a youtuber with a million subs, that is enough to make some money every month.<br /> <br /> Now, on interesting jobs a nova could do, a pirokinetic nova could make a lot cooking things, from cakes to iron ore, all you need is scale to make money\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-19T13:45:22-08:00","id":1470878,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aeonstorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1470864-aberrant-ways-to-make-money-as-a-nova#post1470864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Say you just erupted as a nova on N-day and you decided you wanted to make money, how would you go about it and which powers would you have or do you think would work best?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think specific powers are mostly irrelevant for these purposes. As a Nova you can do stuff that most of the rest of the population (including that wealthy parts) either cannot do (control weather, shoot plasma out of their asses) or can't match in terms of Scale (a really in shape Baseline runner can do a four minute mile. Plenty of Nova can do a 4 picosecond mile). So, whatever you can do, there will likely be plenty of people willing and able to pay you to do it for them.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-19T16:03:21-08:00","id":1470892,"title":"","content":"Hmm yeah I get what your saying. What about a nova with say mega intellect 3 maybe a few other mega attributes as support how do you think he should use his abilities to the full extent to make money.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26058-aeonstorm","name":"Aeonstorm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-19T16:23:54-08:00","id":1470894,"title":"","content":"Mega intellect 3 is so far beyond baslines it isn't even funny. that's the kind of genius that sees inventions that aren't even understood in the Trinity era. So... pretty m uch anything on the market right now? You can improve on. <br /> <br /> When it comes to nova's, I'm reminded of a quote from Microcosmic God, but Theodore Sturgeon: <br /> <br /> &quot;After that money wasn\u2019t money any more. It was large numbers in little books.&quot;<br /> <br /> Essentially, unless your planned project is &quot;buy a nation&quot; or you have some reason to try to stay poor, money just shouldn't be something you think about any more.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-19T18:59:52-08:00","id":1470903,"title":"","content":"Just having Mega Stamina, like, 3, Adaptation and flight means that you could fly to the moon. Heck, you could probably fly to anywhere in the solar system pretty easily. That's why a space based Allegiance was such a good idea, because that's one of the main things that someone with superpowers would do. Who doesn't want to go to space? And how much could you get paid for that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27133-planguy","name":"Planguy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-19T21:32:07-08:00","id":1470908,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aeonstorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1470864-aberrant-ways-to-make-money-as-a-nova#post1470864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Say you just erupted as a nova on N-day and you decided you wanted to make money, how would you go about it and which powers would you have or do you think would work best?</div> </div> </div> </div>Like me specifically? I\u2019d like to think I\u2019d use Mega-Intellect as a political consultant. But the default answer in-universe is you can always sign a sponsorship deal with a major corporation while just showing off how cool your powers are in public regularly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-21T20:56:40-08:00","id":1471066,"title":"","content":"Teleportation powers: boom, you just basically took away the need for spaceflight.<br /> <br /> Here is your bed made of money to go with your golden house, sir.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}